falls out of the other side of the building,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:22.840 --> 00:14:27.760
stunned from the impact. The Polymorphic Soul&nbsp;
Isomer jumps above the injured sorcerer and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.600
