Todo lands on his feet and is able to avoid the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:32.600 --> 00:14:37.880
follow up kick from his opponent. Picking up&nbsp;
a piece of the flying rubble, Todo imbues it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:37.880 --> 00:14:41.126
