switches with the rock to get behind his opponent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:50.440
and delivers a powerful right hook that literally&nbsp;
turns the Polymorphic Soul Isomer into a pancake.

00:14:50.440 --> 00:14:54.920
To Todo's surprise, the transfigured human only&nbsp;
took one hit because the Polymorphic Soul Isomer's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:54.920 --> 00:15:00.840
explosive power comes from expending so many&nbsp;
weak souls at once. Todo figures out how the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:05.680
transfigured human attack specialists work&nbsp;
just as two more arrive to confront him.

00:15:05.680 --> 00:15:11.480
Feeling free of Todo's interference, Mahito piles&nbsp;
on the pressure again Yuji. Slamming his hands&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.480 --> 00:15:16.080
down, he activates Body Repel, creating long&nbsp;
