attacks in order to find an opening to drop-kick&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:20.840 --> 00:15:25.720
Mahito. The curse counters by grabbing Yuji's&nbsp;
leg and throwing him into the ground below.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:25.720 --> 00:15:29.960
The impact breaks apart the ground and sends&nbsp;
Yuji's body along the street, back to the area&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:37.520
