has suddenly rejoined Yuji's side. Standing there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:50.520
Big bro Todo taunts Mahito for really trying to&nbsp;
avoid a two-on one fight. This a beating boy.

00:15:50.520 --> 00:15:56.240
Blown away with how not even two Polymorphic Soul&nbsp;
Isomer's were enough to stall Todo. He knows that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:56.240 --> 00:16:00.920
