manages to block the strike with his knee.

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:26.360
Getting in close to each other&nbsp;
blocks Mahito throws a left hook,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:30.720
still Yuji parries the attack and delivers a&nbsp;
