though, Yuji has performed so well with it,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:08.520
that he fools you, making you&nbsp;
think, that thats what he’s doing!

00:24:08.520 --> 00:24:14.280
Mahito is fully aware Yuji will try and end&nbsp;
the fight using Black Flash. He knows going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:14.280 --> 00:24:20.280
