00:24:20.280 --> 00:24:24.160
In the midst of their exchange of punches.&nbsp;
Mahito partially deactivates the Instant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:24.160 --> 00:24:27.920
Spirit Body of Distorted Killing to the&nbsp;
left side of his body catching Yuji by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:27.920 --> 00:24:32.960
