on in Shibuya and ever since his fight with Choso,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:19.600
Yuji has been able to control Divergent Fist&nbsp;
and has used it to disrupt Mahito's plan.

00:25:19.600 --> 00:25:23.640
Having ducked underneath Mahito's&nbsp;
previous attack, Yuji prepares his own,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:23.640 --> 00:25:29.400
