is no way he doesn't know this fact already.

00:25:34.760 --> 00:25:40.360
Looking like HE HIMSELF, HIMOTHY, Todo Stands&nbsp;
above the crater and still determined to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:40.360 --> 00:25:45.760
